      "index": 0,
      "text": "Recent Announcementsunread,Q & A link --> in Start Here moduleHello all - The Q&A link was accidentally moved to the incorrect module. I moved this up to the Start Here Module Q&A link here. I will be replying back to their regularly through Week 1. We will then move to a Discord or some feature that allows for more realtime communication for an online community. More to come.Posted on:Jun 26, 2026, 10:46 AM"
    },
